# Business notes live outside this repository (D-0006): benchmarks, pivot conditions, the pricing
# ladder and acquisition notes were deliberately moved to private storage before it was published.
# Listed here because a file sitting in the working tree is one `git add -A` away from being in it,
# which is how this rule gets broken by accident rather than by decision.
keypastebusinessnotes.md
*businessnotes*.md
